OL,3,GNEWSAFan found not guilty of racially  
OL,4,Aabusing Semenyo                        
OL,6,FA Liverpool fan accused of racially    
OL,7,Fabusing footballer Antoine Semenyo has 
OL,8,Fbeen found not guilty after the player 
OL,9,Fwithdrew his support for the           
OL,10,Fprosecution.                           
OL,12,FSemenyo was due to give evidence at    
OL,13,FLiverpool Magistrates' Court in the    
OL,14,Ftrial of Mark Mogan, 47, who was       
OL,15,Faccused of shouting racist abuse during
OL,16,Fthe opening match of the Premier League
OL,17,Fseason at Anfield on 15 August last    
OL,18,Fyear.                                  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
