OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFan found not guilty of racially  
OL,4,Aabusing Semenyo                        
OL,6,FBut Simon Jones, prosecuting, said:    
OL,7,F"Following recent contact made with Mr 
OL,8,FSemenyo, he has indicated he is no     
OL,9,Flonger supportive of proceedings and   
OL,10,Fthe prosecution do not consider it is  
OL,11,Fappropriate to compel him.             
OL,13,F"In those circumstances we offer no    
OL,14,Ffurther evidence in the case."         
